# {{name}}

MCP App scaffolded with `mountly-mcp create` (Svelte).

## Runbook

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev
pnpm verify
pnpm verify:render
```

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/view.ts` | `createMcpView` entry |
| `src/Dashboard.svelte` | View UI: `toolResult` prop |
| `server.mjs` | `registerMcpApps` factory |
| `mcp.fixtures.json` | Tool args for `dev --server` |

## Open in a real host

`serve-stdio.mjs` is included. Point Claude Desktop or VS Code at that entry (stdio). ChatGPT: use your connector against the same process.

## CI

```bash
pnpm exec mountly-mcp build
pnpm exec playwright install chromium
pnpm exec mountly-mcp verify --strict --render
```

## Add another View

```bash
pnpm exec mountly-mcp add settings --framework svelte
```
